<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { title: "Better Together — Community &amp; Giving Back — WORKS by JD", description: "WORKS by JD's Better Together program — how we give back to the North Shore community, support neighbors in need, and build more than just homes." }) %>
<body>
<%- include('partials/navbar', { activePage: 'community' }) %>
<%- include('partials/mobile-menu') %>
<div class="nav-offset"></div>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-accent"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span><span>Better Together</span></div>
    <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">Community &amp; Giving Back</div>
    <h1 class="page-hero-title">We build homes. <em>We build community.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-hero-body">WORKS by JD has called the North Shore home since 2001. This corner of Massachusetts isn't just where we work — it's where we live, raise our families, and invest our futures. Better Together is our commitment to leave it better than we found it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- The Program -->
<section class="section-pad bg-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow">The Program</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">What is <em>Better Together?</em></h2>
        <p class="section-body">Better Together is our formal commitment to use our skills, time, and resources to help people and organizations on the North Shore who need it most. It's not a donation checkbox — it's hands, tools, and real construction work donated directly to the community.</p>
        <p class="section-body" style="margin-top:14px;">Twice a year, the WORKS by JD crew takes on a community project — a home repair for a neighbor in need, a renovation for a local nonprofit, or a safety improvement for a family that couldn't otherwise afford it. We supply the labor, our material partners supply what they can, and we show up to work.</p>
        <p class="section-body" style="margin-top:14px;">We've partnered with Beverly Housing Authority, North Shore Community Action Programs (NSCAP), Habitat for Humanity North Shore, and several private individuals who've been referred by local social services. Projects have ranged from accessible bathroom retrofits for elderly homeowners to full kitchen replacements for families in transitional housing.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="background:var(--ember-500);border-radius:var(--r-2xl);padding:48px;color:white;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
          <div style="position:absolute;top:-20px;right:-20px;font-size:120px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:900;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);line-height:1;pointer-events:none;">BT</div>
          <blockquote style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;font-style:italic;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 24px;position:relative;z-index:1;">"We don't just take from a community — we're obligated to give back to it. Especially when you've been working in it for 24 years."</blockquote>
          <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);">— Jesse DeBenedictis, Founder</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:var(--r-2xl);padding:32px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);margin-top:24px;">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-body-subtle);margin-bottom:20px;">Program At a Glance</div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;">
            <div style="text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ember-500);">2×</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--color-body-subtle);">per year, minimum</div></div>
            <div style="text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ember-500);">24+</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--color-body-subtle);">projects completed</div></div>
            <div style="text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ember-500);">5</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--color-body-subtle);">partner organizations</div></div>
            <div style="text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ember-500);">2001</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--color-body-subtle);">program founding year</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Partners -->
<section class="section-pad" style="background:var(--stone-100);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header"><div class="section-eyebrow">Community Partners</div><h2 class="section-title">Organizations we <em>work alongside.</em></h2></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:48px;">
      <div class="why-card">
        <h3 class="why-card-title">Habitat for Humanity North Shore</h3>
        <p class="why-card-body">We volunteer skilled labor on Habitat builds and dedicate one full crew-day per year to a Habitat critical repair project on the North Shore. Habitat brings the homeowners — we bring the tools and expertise.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <h3 class="why-card-title">Beverly Housing Authority</h3>
        <p class="why-card-body">We partner with BHA on accessibility retrofits — grab bars, roll-in showers, widened doorways, and ramp access for elderly and differently-abled residents in BHA properties.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <h3 class="why-card-title">North Shore Community Action Programs</h3>
        <p class="why-card-body">NSCAP refers families experiencing housing instability who need critical home repairs. We do the work; NSCAP helps coordinate materials assistance and homeowner support.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <h3 class="why-card-title">Veterans' Home Repair Initiative</h3>
        <p class="why-card-body">In partnership with local VFW posts, we donate one veteran home repair project per year — anything from a leaking roof to a full bathroom renovation for a North Shore veteran family.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <h3 class="why-card-title">School Vocational Programs</h3>
        <p class="why-card-body">Jesse guest-lectures at Montserrat College of Art and Beverly High School's vocational building trades program — sharing the business and craft realities of a career in Design-Build construction.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <h3 class="why-card-title">Emergency Home Safety Response</h3>
        <p class="why-card-body">Occasionally, we respond to households that experience a critical failure — structural, fire, or flood damage — with emergency stabilization work while longer-term solutions are arranged.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How to Request / Refer -->
<section class="section-pad bg-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Nominate a Project</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Know someone <em>who needs help?</em></h2>
        <p class="section-body">We accept project nominations from partner organizations, community members, and social service providers. We can't take on every request, but we read every one and respond to all referrals from partner organizations within 10 days.</p>
        <p class="section-body" style="margin-top:14px;">Good candidates for Better Together projects:</p>
        <ul class="includes-list" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <li class="include-item"><span class="include-check">✓</span><span>Elderly homeowners who can't maintain safe living conditions</span></li>
          <li class="include-item"><span class="include-check">✓</span><span>Veterans and military families needing critical repairs</span></li>
          <li class="include-item"><span class="include-check">✓</span><span>Families in transitional or subsidized housing with critical needs</span></li>
          <li class="include-item"><span class="include-check">✓</span><span>Nonprofits needing renovation to serve their communities</span></li>
          <li class="include-item"><span class="include-check">✓</span><span>Accessibility modifications for differently-abled homeowners</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:28px;">Submit a Nomination</a>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--forge-950);border-radius:var(--r-2xl);padding:48px;color:white;">
        <div class="section-eyebrow" style="color:var(--ember-400);">For Organizations</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:white;margin:12px 0 16px;">Partner with WORKS</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--forge-300);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px;">If you're a nonprofit, housing authority, or social service organization operating on the North Shore, we'd like to hear from you. Formal partner organizations receive priority referral processing and a dedicated project each year.</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--forge-300);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:32px;">We currently have capacity for one or two new partnership agreements per year. We ask partners to handle client coordination and material assistance — we provide the skilled labor and project management.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-light">Become a Partner Org</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Jesse on Community -->
<section class="section-pad" style="background:var(--forge-900);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:740px;text-align:center;">
    <div class="section-eyebrow" style="color:var(--ember-400);">From the Founder</div>
    <blockquote style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);font-style:italic;font-weight:700;color:white;line-height:1.4;margin:24px 0;">"We've been building on this coastline for over two decades. We know the neighborhoods, the storms, the old houses, the neighbors who've been here since before us. This is our home. Better Together isn't charity — it's responsibility."</blockquote>
    <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--forge-300);">Jesse DeBenedictis · Founder, WORKS by JD</div>
    <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--forge-500);margin-top:4px;">Beverly, MA · North Shore since 2001</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container"><div class="cta-inner">
    <div class="cta-eyebrow">Ready to Build Something?</div>
    <h2 class="cta-title">Your project funds this community.<em> Let's talk.</em></h2>
    <p class="cta-body">Every project we take on helps us do more for the North Shore. Start yours today.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons"><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Start a Project</a><a href="/about/our-story" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg">Our Story</a></div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>